{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_08_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_08","title":"無私鐵棘","storyCode":"PV-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"147340114b1d73a6d5a3a52823baca2f259ef7a07ced3e9082051936698f97e3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月8日    2:17 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，不歡迎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉普蘭德？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼如臨大敵，要是驚擾到病人怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，快告訴法官小姐，我真的只是過來送文件的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著，大法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛在門口碰見個小法官送卷宗來給你。市長大人的病房不能有太多人打擾，我和德克薩斯就順便幫你帶了進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃爾西尼港失火，緊急庭審流程——被告伊雷妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個司機小姐是你的朋友吧？別緊張，往後翻，直接看審判結果，她當庭就被無罪釋放了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和德克薩斯碰巧去聽了那場庭審，很精彩，威尼斯家族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，抱歉抱歉，是威尼斯載具公司和薩盧佐酒業的老闆同時為她作證，還在庭審結束後爭著搶著送她回家……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，司機小姐的人緣可真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是她走出法院的樣子，讓我想起了家族成員們進法院逛一圈出來的成人禮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g5_courtsquare_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月8日    11:35 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"簽名確認，領走判決書，離開法院。流程並不麻煩，但伊雷妮還是覺得有點頭暈。陽光很刺眼，亮得她低下了頭——\n偌大的法院廣場，兩輛車停在她的必經之路上，它們的引擎蓋上各自綴著特製的車標——在敘拉古隨處可見的圖案。\n就算她不認得薩盧佐的酒標和威尼斯的家徽，她也不會不認得車前那兩個剛剛還在法庭上為自己辯護的人。\n伊雷妮知道，他們在等她——薩盧佐家族與威尼斯家族在等她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，伊雷妮小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒什麼好恭喜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托先生，雖然昨天那場火是個意外，但我擔心的事情，確實也因此被糊里糊塗地解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，已經辛苦您白跑了一趟，就更不應該繼續給您添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您今天過來，就等於告訴所有人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐當然要幫卡車工會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從目前的狀況來看，有些交易確實已經不再算數，但你我都清楚，在敘拉古，搭建一段友誼有多麼難能可貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"約定依然存在，伊雷妮小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——阿爾貝托叔叔，我應該沒有打擾你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮小姐是為我們運的輪胎，現在貨在她手裡出了事，我還得找她談談該怎麼賠償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，雖然我們今天才正式認識，但已經相當有默契了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在法庭上什麼都沒有說，這很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於卡車工會，以及許多事情，我想我們已經有很多東西可以交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上車吧，我送你回營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小威尼斯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘹亮的鳴笛聲打斷了三人的對話，一輛卡車從兩輛私家車之間穿過，穩穩地停在了伊雷妮面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"車門打開，伊雷妮看到了下車的柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我來接你回家。營地裡還有很多事情等著你處理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去之後，我們得趕快想辦法送索默爾暫時離開，現在城裡對他來說不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……柳德米拉，你有心事？"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉沒有說話，只是將懷中的那枚打火機交給了伊雷妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……這不是索默爾的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他做了他能做的所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早該明白，家族絕對不會允許任何可能對他們造成威脅的人存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"透過後視鏡，伊雷妮再次對上了小威尼斯與阿爾貝托的眼睛。\n她突然明白這兩人為什麼信心滿滿地站出來替自己作證，又為什麼同時在廣場等自己。\n小威尼斯說得沒錯，她的沉默，以及他們的發聲，意味著三方在法庭上達成了默契。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……索默爾在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，我找不到……"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮握緊了手中的打火機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以事情的發展的確超出了所有人的預料，他們不得不下場保住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但代價……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想讓市政廳和法院的人看到，我們已經和家族綁在同一條船上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那兩個傢伙對你的態度……簡直就像在爭搶地盤。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這場庭審不是事情的結束，它只是開始。\n未來漫長的時間裡，家族將成為卡車互助會的附骨之疽，她不得不和那些人糾纏，繼續保持這種默契，可恥的默契。\n卡車已經離法院廣場越來越遠，她看著手中的打火機，突然沒那麼恐懼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事沒完，阿爾貝托、安東尼奧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和索默爾剛搬來新沃爾西尼的時候，真的相信我們已經遠離了家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵，真可笑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾，對不起，我不會再相信他們中的任何人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多有趣的場面，像是拍電影。薩盧佐的員工、威尼斯的員工，還有卡車司機，圍在那位司機小姐身邊的人，佔了快要半個廣場……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次進法院，說是成年禮，出來的時候都沒有那麼多人迎接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯就更慘了，哈哈，來敘拉古做客，不小心惹上了官司，當時只有我等她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不要再提你那無聊的惡作劇了，拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德小姐，感謝你專程過來提醒。如果沒什麼其他的事，還請離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣，都是我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就是狂歡節了，法官小姐，你們還有的忙呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從昨天中午開始，我一直跟著拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們趕到港口的時候，那場火已經燒得差不多了，和她沒有直接的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的整個晚上，她真的都在到處跑計程車。今天又去了法院，再然後來到了醫院……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我暫時還不清楚她到底要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭，你還在看這份卷宗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"單從卷宗內容來看，這場審判沒有任何問題。但這種感覺太過熟悉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整場庭審流程完整、證據詳實，但除了幫助某個人脫罪，它實際上沒有查明任何真相，也沒有解決任何問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃爾西尼，在敘拉古的其他地方，絕大多數的案子都只能以這樣的一份卷宗收尾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我一度認為，這樣的審判已經不會存在於新沃爾西尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用安慰我，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更在意的是，這些人從什麼時候開始居然會在意一個家族之外的普通人無辜或者有罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況在此之前，整個威尼斯家族在新沃爾西尼的表現幾乎沒有任何可以指摘的地方，小威尼斯卻在此時出了這個頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從德米特里到英格麗——這兩天，我可能一直都追錯了方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但可以肯定的是，在這場庭審之前——或者就是這場庭審，讓他們站在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂遭遇的那場車禍、肇事逃逸的車輛，還有港口的火災，這些事情明顯存在更深的聯繫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐、威尼斯，還有卡車工會，這三方勢力到底在共同隱藏什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭闔上了卷宗，她的手撫過封面上法院的標誌和《新都市管理法案》的字樣。\n片刻後，她抬起了頭。\n德克薩斯看著眼前的朋友，如果說她剛剛還有些低落和迷惑，那麼現在，她已肉眼可見地重新振作了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就是狂歡節了，萊昂到現在還重傷未醒……我已經沒有多少時間去查明他們接下來會有怎樣的圖謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓局勢惡化，更不能坐以待斃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人依然覺得《新都市管理法案》是可以利用的東西，那麼我會告訴他們，在新沃爾西尼，它確實是秩序的根本。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g12_saluzzowinery"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月8日    4:45 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你不能進去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無緣無故闖進我的酒莊，這可不像是你會做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然不能這麼做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過我們會來找你的，阿爾貝托·薩盧佐先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是近兩個月來薩盧佐酒業提交的所有資格審查文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同一批員工，短短兩個月間在你們的註冊資料裡連續變換了好幾次身分，先是保全人員，再是釀酒師等專業技術人員……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們合理懷疑，薩盧佐酒業涉嫌以非法手段規避正常的背景審查流程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請跟我們回去接受調查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變來變去，不是因為一直按照市政廳的要求在改嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們突然把這些舊的資料翻出來，到底有什麼目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟他們說那麼多，這幫警察明顯就是故意針對薩盧佐家！*敘拉古粗口*，我們還交了那麼多的認證金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，不能讓他們在薩盧佐的地盤上把老爺帶走——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住手。不要妨礙警察辦案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們只是懷疑薩盧佐酒業用非法手段規避背景審查，要解釋起來並不難……只是需要時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A&B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A&B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，老爺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個法官的主意，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她當然不會認為憑藉這樣不痛不癢的罪名就能拿我怎麼樣，但至少接下來這幾天，可以將我困在監獄裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，她應該已經去了小威尼斯或者伊雷妮那裡，不然來酒莊的不會是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是正好有空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅憑她掌握的資訊，能在這麼短的時間做出這麼雷厲風行的決策，夠果決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得去年她衝到我府邸找貝納爾多時的軟弱樣子——真是判若兩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些你跟我說沒有用。你要是清清白白，就沒什麼好怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我跟你們走。我會盡量配合你們的調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天在法庭上就說過，這是新沃爾西尼市民應盡的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，整個薩盧佐酒業並不會因為我的離開而停止運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德米特里，你在這段時間裡，應該已經熟悉我們在新沃爾西尼的業務了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，阿爾貝托先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那暫時交給你了，薩盧佐酒業的經理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
